<h3>Memory profile</h3>
<p>At P=16384 (B=1), R2LM saves 5.9 GB (32%) versus the bidirectional dLLM while staying within 0.4 GB of the causal baseline. Peak memory for the bidirectional model grows near-linearly with P (4.5 → 18.5 GB at P=1024→16384); R2LM stays sublinear (4.5 → 12.7 GB) because the SSM cost is bounded by G.</p>
</section>

